# Fortune, Loyal Steed: "up to one creature that saddled it this turn" is a creature that saddled Fortune, each one once.
# On turn 3 Savannah Lions saddle Fortune, then Fortune saddles Bulwark Ox (Fortune saddled a Mount, but not itself), Rustler
# Rampage untaps all of Bot1's creatures, and the Lions saddle Fortune a second time. Fortune attacks; at end of combat
# Fortune is not offered as a creature that saddled it, and the Lions are the one choice (asked once, though they saddled
# twice). The Lions come back untapped with Fortune, which scries again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Fortune, Loyal Steed
Bulwark Ox
Savannah Lions
Rustler Rampage
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
