Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rustler Rampage.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
